      "description": "• A how-to video on product usage that demonstrates how to clean and maintain a tabletop fountain pump, covering full disassembly, washing, and reassembly of the pump's components. • Disassembly involves detaching the front panel, brushing off dirt, removing the protective rotor cap, and pulling out the central magnetic rotor using a small metal tool. • Cleaning and reassembly involve rinsing all parts in clean water with a brush, then reinserting the magnetic rotor, securing the rotor cover, and reattaching the outer guard to complete the maintenance.",
